+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, so there is no dev-build exemption. This is reinforced by the more recent decision of "https everywhere, no exceptions", which means no host, internal ones included, is carved out to use plain http or to skip verification.
